      "english": "There is leftover food.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "00001_amaru_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{力|ちから}→力：01661_chikara⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{余|あま}る⟦{仕事|しごと}→仕事：00480_shigoto⟧だ。",
      "english": "It's a job beyond my abilities.",
      "notes": null,
